# Default values of struct fields: hover shows them (on the type, on a
# field's declaration and on its use), and completion right inside a struct
# literal offers the fields it does not set yet, with their defaults.
open defaults/main.sd
hover defaults/main.sd 12 17
hover defaults/main.sd 6 12
hover defaults/main.sd 13 19
completion defaults/main.sd 12 24
completion defaults/main.sd 12 4
